# HTTP headers applied by Cloudflare Workers' static-asset serving.
# Vite copies `public/_headers` verbatim into `dist/`, and Cloudflare
# Workers' assets pipeline reads it as a route → header map. The most
# specific matching rule wins for a given header name.
#
# CSP notes:
#   - `script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'` — no 'unsafe-inline': the
#     build emits no inline scripts (Vite's modulepreload polyfill is
#     disabled in vite.config.ts; the JSON-LD block is data, not script).
#     'wasm-unsafe-eval' is what DuckDB-WASM needs to compile its modules.
#   - `worker-src 'self' blob:` — DuckDB-WASM's workers (same-origin asset
#     URLs + blob wrappers).
#   - `connect-src … https:` — datasets / the DuckDB-WASM .wasm (jsDelivr)
#     are fetched from arbitrary https origins (URL import, embed datasets).
#   - `style-src 'unsafe-inline'` — the inline <style> in index/embed.html
#     plus styles Vega / CodeMirror inject at runtime.
#   - `frame-ancestors` MUST be an HTTP header (the CSP spec disallows it
#     from <meta>). The main app forbids framing; /embed is a public
#     embeddable widget, framable by any origin (read-only, no auth).

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https: blob: data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'

/embed
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https: blob: data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors *

/embed.html
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https: blob: data:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors *
